@startuml
title WAGI – Ingestion-Sequenz
actor User
participant "wa-connector" as C
participant "Baileys" as W
participant "tg-connector" as T
participant "Telegram Bot API" as TG
database "Postgres" as DB
queue "NATS JetStream" as N
participant "ai-worker" as AI

User -> C: QR scannen / Linked Device
C -> W: Auth-State laden
W --> C: connection.open
W -> C: messages.upsert
C -> DB: upsert wa_group + message
C -> N: publish wa.messages.received
N -> AI: deliver message event
AI -> DB: upsert message_analyses
AI -> N: publish ai.messages.analyzed
== Telegram Bot API ==
T -> TG: getUpdates (Long Polling)
TG --> T: message / channel_post
T -> DB: upsert tg:<chat-id> + message
T -> N: publish wa.messages.received
N -> AI: deliver message event
note over C,DB
Nur ausgewählte Gruppen werden
nach der Gruppenauswahl verarbeitet.
end note
@enduml
